 # Filtered Search
 
-An ANN search finds vector embeddings most similar to specified vector embeddings. However, the search results may not always be correct. You can include filtering conditions in a search request so that Milvus conducts metadata filtering before conducting ANN searches, reducing the search scope from the whole collection to only the entities matching the specified filtering conditions.
+An ANN search finds vector embeddings most similar to specified vector embeddings. However, the search results may not always be correct. You can include filtering conditions in a search request so that {{var.product_name}} conducts metadata filtering before conducting ANN searches, reducing the search scope from the whole collection to only the entities matching the specified filtering conditions.
 
 ## Overview
 
-In Milvus, filtered searches are categorized into two types — **standard filtering** and **iterative filtering** — depending on the stage at which the filtering is applied.
+In {{var.product_name}}, filtered searches are categorized into two types — **standard filtering** and **iterative filtering** — depending on the stage at which the filtering is applied.
 
 ### Standard filtering
 
-If a collection contains both vector embeddings and their metadata, you can filter metadata before ANN search to improve the relevancy of the search result. Once Milvus receives a search request carrying a filtering condition, it restricts the search scope within the entities matching the specified filtering condition.
+If a collection contains both vector embeddings and their metadata, you can filter metadata before ANN search to improve the relevancy of the search result. Once {{var.product_name}} receives a search request carrying a filtering condition, it restricts the search scope within the entities matching the specified filtering condition.
 
